{"id":"z6gf270gefhpcrfqq2hvz8n7a","title":"Galaxy Corporation 计划明年1月推出实体人形机器人女团","originalTitle":"机器人女团明年1月出道，具身智能正密集走向舞台","summary":"Galaxy Corporation 计划于明年1月推出实体人形机器人女团，并在澳门举办首演预热。其营收同比增长619%（基数低），但面临规模化生产与海外运维挑战。合作模式包含中国硬件供应商宇树科技提供机器人，韩国团队开发K-pop内容，商业化端由Galaxy主导，涉及演唱会、主题乐园及IP衍生。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"华尔街见闻"},"links":{"original":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3786192"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T09:22:20.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T11:35:53.770Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T11:35:53.770Z","category":"stock-asia-tech","tags":["产品上线","合作"],"score":53,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}